# SmartLand — Land Verification & Management System

## Overview

SmartLand is a mobile-first web application designed to combat land fraud in Tanzania/Zanzibar by providing a digital land registry with unique Land Codes and QR verification. Citizens can verify land ownership before purchasing, Land Officers manage the registry, and Administrators oversee the entire platform.

**Stack**: React 19 + Vite + Tailwind CSS v4 + React Router — hosted as a static PWA (Progressive Web App) that works on both mobile and desktop browsers.

---

## Architecture

```
SmartLand App (PWA)
├── Landing Page (Login/Register)
├── Citizen Dashboard (Mobile-first)
│   ├── Home Dashboard (Cards + Quick Actions)
│   ├── Verify Land (Code input + QR Scanner)
│   ├── Land Details Page
│   ├── Map View (Leaflet.js)
│   ├── Verification History
│   ├── Saved Lands
│   └── Report Fraud
├── Land Owner Dashboard
│   ├── My Lands
│   ├── Request Changes
│   └── Download Documents
├── Land Officer Dashboard (Desktop-oriented)
│   ├── Overview Stats (Cards)
│   ├── Register New Land
│   ├── Pending Approvals
│   ├── Disputes Management
│   └── GIS Map View
└── Admin Dashboard (Desktop-oriented)
    ├── System Overview (Cards + Charts)
    ├── User Management
    ├── Revenue Analytics
    ├── All Lands Registry
    └── Fraud Reports
```

