## User Roles & Dashboards

| Role | Primary Device | Key Features |
|------|---------------|-------------|
| **Citizen** | Mobile | Verify by code/QR, view land details, save/report |
| **Land Owner** | Mobile/Web | Manage own lands, download docs, track history |
| **Land Officer** | Web | Register lands, approve changes, manage disputes |
| **Administrator** | Web | Full system control, revenue analytics, user mgmt |

