## Proposed Pages & Components

### 1. Landing / Auth Page
- Animated hero with SmartLand logo
- Login form with role selector
- Demo accounts for each role
- Tagline: *"Verify Before You Buy"*

### 2. Citizen Dashboard (Mobile-first)
**Top Section:**
- Greeting card with user avatar
- Quick verification search bar (prominent)

**Cards Row:**
- ✅ Verified Lands (count)
- 📜 Verification History
- ⭐ Saved Properties
- 🔔 Notifications (badge)

**Quick Actions Grid:**
- 🔍 Verify Land (Code input)
- 📷 Scan QR Code
- 📍 View Map
- 📋 My History
- 🚨 Report Fraud
- 👤 My Profile

**Recent Verifications List** (last 3)

### 3. Land Verification Flow
- Code input with real-time formatting (ZNZ-2026-XXXX)
- OR QR code scanner modal
- Loading animation → Results

**Land Details Card:**
- Plot number, Owner name, Location, Size
- Status badge (Verified ✅ / In Dispute ⚠️ / Unregistered ❌)
- Interactive mini-map
- Action buttons: View Map | Download Report | Save | Report Issue

### 4. Land Officer Dashboard (Web)
**Header Cards (4):**
- Total Registered Lands
- Pending Approvals
- Active Disputes
- This Month Registrations

**Charts:**
- Bar chart: Lands registered per month
- Pie chart: Land status distribution
- Line chart: Verification requests trend

**Sidebar Navigation:**
- Dashboard, Lands Registry, Approvals, GIS Maps, Disputes, Reports, Settings

**Land Registration Form:**
- Plot number (auto-generated)
- Owner details
- Location (coordinates)
- Size (sqm/acres)
- Documents upload
- Map pin placement

### 5. Admin Dashboard
**Header Cards (5):**
- Total Users, Total Lands, Monthly Verifications, Revenue Generated, Fraud Reports

**Revenue Analytics Chart** (line chart, monthly income)

**User Management Table** (with role badges, status, actions)

**Recent Activity Feed** (live-like with timestamps)

