## Design System

- **Primary Color**: `#1B4F72` (Deep Ocean Blue — trust, authority)
- **Accent**: `#27AE60` (Verified Green — success, nature)
- **Warning**: `#F39C12` (Amber — caution, disputes)
- **Danger**: `#C0392B` (Red — fraud alerts)
- **Background**: `#0D1B2A` (Dark Navy) / `#F0F4F8` (Light mode)
- **Typography**: Inter (Google Fonts)
- **Style**: Dark glassmorphism cards with subtle gradients, mobile-first responsive

---

## Technical Features

- **PWA** — installable on mobile like a native app
- **QR Code Scanner** — using device camera (html5-qrcode library CDN)
- **Interactive Maps** — Leaflet.js with OpenStreetMap tiles
- **Charts** — Chart.js for analytics
- **Local State** — JavaScript mock data (JSON) simulating a real API
- **Role-based routing** — JavaScript SPA with page switching

